(x, y, z) `=> x `+ y `+ z
//│ Type: CodeBase[out ('x, 'y, 'z) -> 'cde, ⊥, ?]
//│ Where:
//│   'x <: Int
//│   'x#Int ∨ 'cde1#Int ∨  ∧ Int<:'app ∧ ⊥<:⊥ ∧ 'cde2<:Int
